      "check_name": "LinkToHref",
      "message": "Potentially unsafe model attribute in `link_to` href",
      "file": "app/views/reference_lists/show.html.erb",
      "line": 9,
      "note": "Closed twice over. ReferenceList#source_url has a model validation anchored at both ends (%r{\\Ahttps?://\\S+\\z}i), so no non-http(s) scheme can be saved through any path that runs validations; and the view calls ReferenceList#safe_source_url, which re-parses at render time and returns nil unless the result is a URI::HTTP with a host. Brakeman flags any model-derived href and cannot see either guard."
    }
  ],
